177
00:09:48,588 --> 00:09:49,255
Bang!

178
00:09:49,255 --> 00:09:49,589
Wow!

179
00:09:49,589 --> 00:09:51,458
I... I understand!

180
00:09:51,458 --> 00:09:52,926
No microwaves!

181
00:09:54,394 --> 00:09:55,395
