Beelu, be careful!

190
00:10:09,342 --> 00:10:11,344
Remember to wear gloves when handling hot things!

191
00:10:12,612 --> 00:10:14,414
Next, give the eggs a cold bath

192
00:10:14,414 --> 00:10:15,682
