202
00:10:33,900 --> 00:10:36,569
Wow! The sauce is so dark!

203
00:10:36,569 --> 00:10:39,372
It's like a bottomless braising sauce dam!

204
00:10:40,707 --> 00:10:42,909
That's right. Once the sauce boils,

205
00:10:42,909 --> 00:10:45,378
