214
00:11:04,597 --> 00:11:06,266
Just the right amount is best

215
00:11:11,271 --> 00:11:12,805
It's time for today's

216
00:11:12,805 --> 00:11:14,607
Food Facts!

217
00:11:18,745 --> 00:11:20,346
If you keep braising an egg,

218
00:11:20,346 --> 00:11:21,681
it will get smaller and smaller

219
00:11:21,681 --> 00:11:23,683
and eventually turn into a firm, chewy iron egg

220
00:11:24,217 --> 00:11:25,018
Got it!

221
00:11:25,618 --> 00:11:26,486
A soft-boiled marinated egg

222
00:11:26,486 --> 00:11:28,021
is made by soaking a peeled boiled egg

223
00:11:28,021 --> 00:11:29,956
in cold braising sauce

224
00:11:30,757 --> 00:11:31,558
Cool!

225
00:11:32,492 --> 00:11:34,227
I want to learn more!

226
00:11:34,227 --> 00:11:34,627
No problem!

227
00:11:36,095 --> 00:11:37,764
If you peel a hard-boiled egg and braise it,

228
00:11:37,764 --> 00:11:38,898
it becomes a braised egg

229
00:11:38,898 --> 00:11:40,633
If you braise it without peeling the shell,

230
00:11:40,633 --> 00:11:41,901
it becomes a tea egg

231
00:11:43,102 --> 00:11:44,103
Remember, round eggs

232
00:11:44,103 --> 00:11:46,239
must never be heated in a microwave

233
00:11:46,239 --> 00:11:47,440
because they can explode

234
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,575
It's very dangerous!

235
00:11:50,510 --> 00:11:52,779
I love delicious food!

236
00:11:59,986 --> 00:12:01,988
